{"availability":"available","full":"t8nlab/titanpl","name":"titanpl","description":"Titan Planet is a JavaScript-first backend framework that embeds JS actions into a Rust + Axum server and ships as a single native binary. Routes are compiled to static metadata; only actions run in the embedded JS runtime. No Node.js. No event loop in production.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":103,"forks":2,"created":"2025-12-05T18:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-25T09:10:18Z","license":"ISC","branch":"main","homepage":"https://titanpl.vercel.app","topics":["javascript","rust","titanpl","titanpl-cli","titanpl-ext","titanpl-sdk"],"demo":"https://titanpl.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:00.535Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:00.535Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:00.535Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T09:08:37.541Z","stars":103,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-16T02:47:00.535Z","stars":103,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["You write zero Rust. TitanPl handles routing, bundling, runtime execution, hot reload, and deployment — all powered by Rust under the hood.","Titan Planet is a JavaScript/TypeScript-first Backend Framework that compiles your application into a single, high-performance native binary. It embeds it's own Gravity (V8) JavaScript runtime directly into a specialized Rust + Axum server.","TypeScript Precision. JavaScript Simplicity. Native Rust Power. Zero Configuration."],"features":["⚡ Native-level performance","📦 Single binary deployment","🧠 Strict TypeScript enforcement","🛡 Zero type errors before runtime","🚀 No DevOps configuration required"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/t8nlab/titanpl/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a80fe34dca370bacd3c7d60d59c116e1cb51f5e927306ce8e53ef06de891e88a","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:37.725Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:37.725Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"You write